-- a statistic that cannot be decoded (here a negative Int64 read as UInt64) leaves the bound
-- at the Range infinity sentinel, which is a Null Field and would be compared as a SQL NULL;
-- an unbounded side can never prove exclusion, so the row group must not be skipped
