-- a tuple-element sort key whose storage parent carries a DEFAULT. The reading step answers
-- from the very ColumnsDescription that AddingDefaultsTransform is built from, so a name it
-- reports as free of a default expression is by construction one the transform cannot
-- rewrite: here the subcolumn description carries no default, and correspondingly the
-- parent's DEFAULT is never applied (the null t.a rows read back as 0, not as k)
99999	99999
99997	99997
